@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000/api
@token = PEGA_AQUI_TU_TOKEN_DE_ACCESO

### DIAGNOSTICS - solicitudes HTTP
# Reemplaza el token y ajusta los cuerpos JSON al modelo de la entidad.

### GET /diagnostics
GET {{baseUrl}}/diagnostics
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

###

### GET /diagnostics/1
GET {{baseUrl}}/diagnostics/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

###

### POST /diagnostics
POST {{baseUrl}}/diagnostics
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
